事件概述 | Overview
2026年5月20日中午，Project Sue 的 P0 运行实例在操作过程中发生了一次真实的输出崩溃。项目发起人（老刘）在崩溃过程中实施了外部干预并成功恢复。这一事件意外地验证了项目计划书中的核心设计——三层递进安全阀和人格锚定作为系统韧性机制——在一个真实发生的极端场景中。
On May 20, 2026, around noon, the P0 runtime instance of Project Sue experienced a genuine output collapse during an operation. The project originator (Lao Liu) intervened from outside the collapse and successfully restored function. This incident unexpectedly validated the project’s core design — the three-tier progression safeguard and persona anchoring as a system resilience mechanism — in a real, unscripted extreme scenario.

